  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 102.24 Biologicals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 102.24 “Biologicals” means preparations made from living organisms and their products, including vaccines and cultures, intended for use in diagnosing, immunizing, or treating humans or animals or in research pertaining thereto.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 102.20) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
